Alphabet, the parent company of Google, has been at the forefront of Artificial Intelligence (AI) research and development for years. The company's AI initiatives have revolutionized the tech industry, transforming the way we interact with technology and changing the competitive landscape of the industry. In this article, we'll delve into Alphabet's AI dominance, exploring its impact on the tech industry and the future prospects for AI research and development.

**Alphabet's AI Advancements and Applications**

